00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:02.690
So it's very much, like, try it.

00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:04.560
It's free to try,
and it's instant.

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:07.060
So you'll find out immediately
if it can be useful.

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:09.803
And if it is, it's quick as
well to just implement and use.

00:15:09.803 --> 00:15:12.220
So it's one of these things--
like I said previously, it's

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:14.960
just a really quick win if
it can solve your problem.

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:16.040
So it's worth trying out.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:18.200
So I'd say look into the docs.

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:20.930
There's usually
quick-to-activate demos.

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:22.680
And yeah, just try them out.

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:24.680
ANU SRIVASTAVA: Yeah, I
