00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:58.700
but you can leverage the
concepts that they've learned

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:00.910
and kind of just adjust
them for your data set.

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:04.970
So TensorFlow Hub is a great way
to pull those down and leverage

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:08.630
those models if you want
to do some custom work.

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:10.589
So let's move on to
